@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
   A layout that is actually bare: no top bar, no auth chrome, no game slots —
   just the page.

   Note this is NOT the same thing as EmptyLayout, despite the name: EmptyLayout
   is "empty" only in the sense that it omits MainLayout's `<main>` content box
   (PoRacer's canvas is `position: fixed` and cannot live inside one). It still
   renders the full top bar, including a Sign in / Sign out button.

   Used by the sign-in page, where that chrome would be actively wrong: it offers
   a "Sign out" button to someone with no session, and a brand link that leads
   straight back into the gate the visitor is currently standing at.
*@

@Body
